{"title":"2022 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 6","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Solution_3\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 3</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Solution_4\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 4</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Solution_5\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 5</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_1_(Quick_and_Easy)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution 1 (Quick and Easy)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">8</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-9\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">9</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Which expression is equal to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/8/4/984209dd4e5f26c2736cb3fd5c2248f83f75fd36.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\left|a-2-\\sqrt{(a-1)^2}\\right|\\]\" width=\"150\" height=\"44\" /> for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/f/5/6f537b3b21a6edd1fd0ffe37d1fb22a989df562b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a&lt;0?$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"53\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/5/4/3543833138070a21b74029f2fecdd045cc6f8278.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A) } 3-2a \\qquad \\textbf{(B) } 1-a \\qquad \\textbf{(C) } 1 \\qquad \\textbf{(D) } a+1 \\qquad \\textbf{(E) } 3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"460\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We have \n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/3/4132eefb93f7cd74539174068e167d9127ac7f41.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\begin{align*} \\left|a-2-\\sqrt{(a-1)^2}\\right| &amp;= \\left|a-2-|a-1|\\right| \\\\ &amp;=\\left|a-2-(1-a)\\right| \\\\ &amp;=\\left|2a-3\\right| \\\\ &amp;=\\boxed{\\textbf{(A) } 3-2a}. \\end{align*}\" width=\"303\" height=\"129\" />\n~MRENTHUSIASM\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Assume that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/2/0/e20f40b858f202848232ab948fca5c19ded2a1fd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a=-1.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"64\" height=\"15\" /> Then, the given expression simplifies to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/0/79069377f91364c2f87a64e5f9f562a091c8a6c1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/8/e/58e98265468169e13e3fb84f034344aa3a62cadf.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\begin{align*} \\left|a-2-\\sqrt{(a-1)^2}\\right| &amp;= \\left|-1-2-\\sqrt{(-1-1)^2}\\right| \\\\ &amp;= \\left|-1-2-\\sqrt{4}\\right| \\\\ &amp;= \\left|-1-2-2\\right| \\\\ &amp;= 5. \\end{align*}\" width=\"357\" height=\"128\" />\nThen, we test each of the answer choices to see which one is equal to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/0/79069377f91364c2f87a64e5f9f562a091c8a6c1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/b/5/eb5894989301eac86cb0536f0a8ae23256a8a972.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A) } 3-2a = 3-2\\cdot(-1) = 3+2 = 5.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"306\" height=\"20\" /> \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/c/6/4c6994fab310684015062119ba8f2cb9e6ddd8ca.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(B) } 1-a = 1-(-1) = 2 \\neq 5.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"242\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/c/e/ace458ac6016ee4cee38b85fadc07367a56edca2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(C) } 1 \\neq 5.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"84\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/b/3/0b3321b64a1046dbb17cb91352a58c9866e5e9f3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(D) } a+1 = -1+1 = 0 \\neq 5.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"229\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/d/01d4319582cba97c0cc53120851fee972f9bc7a5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(E) } 3 \\neq 5.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"83\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p>The only answer choice equal to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/0/79069377f91364c2f87a64e5f9f562a091c8a6c1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/7/817555099cf3c1ef68bd2e5b1f4bd27d48cbbb6c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a=-1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"56\" height=\"12\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/2/f/e2f0350aa68d5fc851e14cefa01444cf039b1716.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(A) } 3-2a}.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"104\" height=\"30\" />\n</p><p>-MathWizard09\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_3\">Solution 3</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 3\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The given function is continuous, so assume that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/8/4/7846a667ee0762b31661ab860733c12ecbadf88b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a=0.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"50\" height=\"14\" /> Then, the given expression simplifies to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/3/0/93032f1ab8b685d84a767a2fde0d9006a464b5e4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3.$\" width=\"12\" height=\"12\" />\n</p><p>We test each of the answer choices and get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/3/2/632c5f19b4648ce4c0d39dbcb6297cc785abfa67.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A) } 3-2a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"87\" height=\"18\" /> or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/0/a/70a11a02a821335f16b11d99417cecb218946a34.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(E) } 3.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"50\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p>We test <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/f/a/3fa9575ea5dc505ee75ec30d4e4c36d1cce7d90c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = - 1000$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"87\" height=\"15\" /> and get  <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/1/5/f153f4121a0503623f0b605c364788e835e16d01.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\left|-1000-2- \\text{positive} \\right| \\ne 3 \\implies \\boxed{\\textbf{(A) } 3-2a}.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"357\" height=\"30\" />\n</p><p><b>vladimir.shelomovskii@gmail.com, vvsss</b>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_4\">Solution 4</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 4\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We know that ,\n</p><p>\\(\\begin{aligned} &amp; |x|=x, \\text { if } x&gt;0 \\\\ &amp; =-x, \\text { if } x&lt;0 \\\\ &amp; \\text { Now, }\\left|a-2-\\sqrt{(a-1)^2}\\right|=\\left|a-2-\\sqrt{(1-a)^2}\\right|, \\text { as }  a&lt;0 \\\\ &amp; =|a-2-(1-a)| \\\\ &amp; =|2 a-3| \\\\ &amp; =-(2 a-3) \\text { as } a&lt;0 \\\\ &amp; =3-2 a\\end{aligned}\\) \n</p><p>So, the correct choice is option <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/2/f/e2f0350aa68d5fc851e14cefa01444cf039b1716.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(A) } 3-2a}.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"104\" height=\"30\" />\n</p><p>~KENJAKURA\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_5\">Solution 5</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 5\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Because the degree of the expression is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, and all the solutions are of degree <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/1/bc1f9d9bf8a1b606a4188b5ce9a2af1809e27a89.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, we can assume the function is linear for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/f/8/ef8362e1f78725beb1de44c30360f0a10d0d3c82.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a&lt;0$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"42\" height=\"13\" /> and try values to find what the function is.\n</p><p>We can first say from Solution 1 that: \n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/0/2/f021dcba8e44cc34e6d06995cd0f2d99b3bf6d78.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\left|a-2-\\sqrt{(a-1)^2}\\right| = \\left|a-2-|a-1|\\right|\\]\" width=\"299\" height=\"44\" />\nThen, we can try values:\n\\begin{array}{cccc}\na &amp; \\text{Plug in values} &amp; = &amp; \\text{Result} \\\\\n\\hline\n-1 &amp; \\left|-1-2-\\left|-1-1\\right|\\right| &amp; = &amp; \\left|-3-2\\right| = 5 \\\\\n-2 &amp; \\left|-2-2-\\left|-2-1\\right|\\right| &amp; = &amp; \\left|-4-3\\right| = 7 \\\\\n-3 &amp; \\left|-3-2-\\left|-3-1\\right|\\right| &amp; = &amp; \\left|-5-4\\right| = 9 \\\\\n\\end{array}\nWe can see that this is a linear function. We can find that the slope is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/2/e/12e868a5b8041f2d42a8c433f1718ee0498e995e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m = \\frac{7-5}{-2-(-1)} = \\frac{2}{-1} = -2.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"233\" height=\"43\" /> \nUsing the first pair:\n\\begin{aligned}\ny &amp; = mx+b \\\\\n5 &amp; = -2(-1)+b \\\\\n5 &amp; = 2+b \\\\\n3 &amp; = b \\\\\ny &amp; = -2x+3 \\\\\n\\end{aligned}\n</p><p>We take that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/2/092e364e1d9d19ad5fffb0b46ef4cc7f2da02c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> equals the expression, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" />. This gives <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/7/f/d7ffaab266ff94c70a54c00157691ed894e24ee7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-2a+3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"66\" height=\"15\" />, or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/1/9/d19fa0a930a4334de4f7be5a28084b7b3e94f90e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3-2a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"52\" height=\"15\" />.\nTesting to make sure the answer is correct (like that in Solution 2) is a good practice to have and shows that the correct choice must be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/2/f/e2f0350aa68d5fc851e14cefa01444cf039b1716.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(A) } 3-2a}.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"104\" height=\"30\" />\n</p><p>~Eugenius\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Video_Solution_1_.28Quick_and_Easy.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_1_(Quick_and_Easy)\">Video Solution 1 (Quick and Easy)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=7\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution 1 (Quick and Easy)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/ZWHzdrW4rvw\">https://youtu.be/ZWHzdrW4rvw</a>\n</p><p>~Education, the Study of Everything\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_2\">Video Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=8\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/XWTTtL9kW98\">https://youtu.be/XWTTtL9kW98</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=9\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_10A\" title=\"2022 AMC 10A\">2022 AMC 10A</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_10A_Problems\" title=\"2022 AMC 10A Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_10A_Answer_Key\" title=\"2022 AMC 10A Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/community/c13\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2022 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 5\">Problem 5</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"2022 A